	(paper "A4")
	(title_block
		(title "Servo UART bridge: CH344Q quad UART on hub port DS4")
		(rev "A")
		(comment 1 "Sheet 11 — see HARDWARE.md §8, FUNCTIONAL.md")
	)
	(lib_symbols)
	(text "SERVO UART — CH344Q, USB 2.0 from hub DS4, four UARTs → servo-port-0..3 (UART index ↔ port index is fixed: software contract)\nGolden reference: datasheets/ch344.pdf (CH344DS1, Chinese; TNOW facts in FUNCTIONAL.md §5.2)\nParts (LCSC): CH344Q C2988084, USBLC6-2 C2687116 on DS4_DP/DM\nTNOW: DTRx/TNOWx/GPIOx pins (Q package 39, 18, 19, 34) become TNOW with a 4.7 kΩ pull-down at power-on. Add 10 kΩ pull-downs on the TNOW lines (idle = receive).\nRXD: fit 10 kΩ pull-ups to +3V3 on all four RXDx (RXD3 has no internal pull-up).\nOpen items: V1 (TNOW polarity — scope the dongle first), V2 (TNOW release latency vs Return Delay Time)\nConsumes: +3V3, GND.  Test points on every TXD/RXD/TNOW."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
